# =============================================================================
# This file intentionally holds NO pnpm settings anymore.
#
# Sprint 2.5.1 (pnpm 9.15 -> 11 upgrade): pnpm 10+ stopped reading its own
# config (node-linker, store-dir, prefer-frozen-lockfile, fund, audit, etc.)
# from `.npmrc`. Those settings — plus the dependency `overrides` and the
# build-script approval — now live in `pnpm-workspace.yaml` (camelCase keys).
# See https://pnpm.io/settings.
#
# `.npmrc` is retained only as the home for any future npm-compatible
# registry / auth keys (e.g. a private registry or an auth token). There are
# none today. If you add pnpm CONFIG here it will be silently ignored by
# pnpm 11 — put it in pnpm-workspace.yaml instead.
# =============================================================================
